rustls-native-certs on powerpc / powerpc64 Darwin (Mac OS X 10.4-10.6): load the CA bundle from a PEM
file, as OpenSSL does, instead of the keychain through security-framework (which needs Security.framework
entry points newer than 10.6, and whose 10.6 roots are long out of date). Drops the security-framework
dependency there (tombi: security-framework 3.7.0 no longer gets built).

Path: MACPORTS_CA_BUNDLE at build time, else /opt/local/share/curl/curl-ca-bundle.crt (port curl-ca-bundle).
SSL_CERT_FILE / SSL_CERT_DIR at run time still take precedence.

